    "Name": "Morpheus",
    "Details": "This variant removes the Claw and Spikes, replaces the heavy ferro-fibrous with reactive armor, swaps the Magshot for a laser AMS and adds an ER medium laser to each arm as well as adding three additional double heat sinks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>",
